{"parents": [], "prev": null, "next": {"link": "api/agent/", "title": "Agents"}, "title": "API Reference", "meta": null, "body": "<section id=\"api-reference\">\n<h1>API Reference<a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#api-reference\" title=\"Link to this heading\">\u00b6</a></h1>\n<p>Riferimento delle API pubbliche di PyOrchestrate, generato dalle docstring\ndei sorgenti.</p>\n<div class=\"toctree-wrapper compound\">\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toctree-l1\"><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"api/agent/\">Agents</a><ul>\n<li class=\"toctree-l2\"><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"api/agent/#module-PyOrchestrate.core.agent.base_agent\">PyOrchestrate.core.agent.base_agent</a></li>\n<li class=\"toctree-l2\"><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"api/agent/#module-PyOrchestrate.core.agent.looping_agent\">PyOrchestrate.core.agent.looping_agent</a></li>\n<li class=\"toctree-l2\"><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"api/agent/#module-PyOrchestrate.core.agent.periodic_agent\">PyOrchestrate.core.agent.periodic_agent</a></li>\n<li class=\"toctree-l2\"><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"api/agent/#module-PyOrchestrate.core.agent.pool_agent\">PyOrchestrate.core.agent.pool_agent</a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toctree-l1\"><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"api/orchestrator/\">Orchestrator</a><ul>\n<li class=\"toctree-l2\"><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"api/orchestrator/#module-PyOrchestrate.core.orchestrator.orchestrator\">PyOrchestrate.core.orchestrator.orchestrator</a></li>\n<li class=\"toctree-l2\"><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"api/orchestrator/#module-PyOrchestrate.core.orchestrator.lifecycle_manager\">PyOrchestrate.core.orchestrator.lifecycle_manager</a></li>\n<li class=\"toctree-l2\"><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"api/orchestrator/#module-PyOrchestrate.core.orchestrator.dependency_graph\">PyOrchestrate.core.orchestrator.dependency_graph</a></li>\n<li class=\"toctree-l2\"><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"api/orchestrator/#module-PyOrches